<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Code-signing entitlements for Keyglass Studio and its helper executables,
  signed with the hardened runtime and notarized.

  The set is intentionally empty. The app is not sandboxed, so USB access
  through IOKit, the local daemon API and network requests need no
  entitlement. The web view's JavaScript JIT runs in the system WebKit
  processes, so no allow-jit exception is needed, and every executable is
  statically linked against its non-system code, so library validation stays
  enabled. Add an exception here only together with the reason it is required.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
